# -*- mode:org; coding:utf-8 -*-
#+TITLE: deferred-getcname-other-locales -- getcname tables for the locales other than fr_FR, and BricsCAD's COMMANDS listing
#+STATUS: DEFERRED
#+PRIORITY: P3
#+TYPE: feature
#+DEPENDS: cadtui-locale-probe-getcname
#+BRANCH: -
#+DATE: 2026-10-26

cadtui-locale-probe-getcname (closed 2026-10-26) harvested fr_FR on every
product and made clautolisp's GETCNAME real. Left:

1. Other locales (de_DE, es_ES ... -- cadtui already has verb / keyword
   tables for them): one localised AutoCAD / BricsCAD install per locale on
   a runner (pjb's provisioning). Then run the getcname probe there and
   regenerate cadtui's <locale>/command.sexp
   (scripts/cadtui-getcname-to-sexp.py) and cador's data/getcname/<locale>.sexp
   (scripts/getcname-to-cador.py).
2. BricsCAD's COMMANDS listing (English + localised), which the issue asked
   for besides getcname.
3. The probe's command list is a curated 143; the dash commands (-LAYER ...)
   and more are worth adding, since GETCNAME answers only for the commands
   in its tables.
